  "assumptions": [
    "member.national_insurance_number is a candidate key to enforce uniqueness of registration; duplicates are prevented by application logic",
    "employer tax_id is a candidate key to enforce unique employer identity; changes flagged by application logic",
    "contribution_receipt references account_id via a nullable FK to support receipts not yet allocated",
    "reconciliation tracks submission/receipt/allocation linkage with one row per comparison; unmatched amounts stored as derived amount",
    "audit entities record field-level material changes; calculation logic is not altered by audit records",
    "benefit_workflow supports multiple sequential review/approval steps per request",
    "duty_segment on system_user enforces segregation of submission, review, and approval duties without extra tables",
    "investment trading and portfolio execution are out of scope; investment stores approved allocations only"
  ]
